{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02558","headline":"侍宴莎册宫应制得情字 · 许敬宗","name":"侍宴莎册宫应制得情字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三星希曙景，万骑翊天行。\n葆羽翻风队，腾吹掩山楹。\n暖日晨光浅，飞烟旦彩轻。\n塞寒桃变色，冰断箭流声。\n渐奏长安道，神皐动睿情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}